                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Cool game, but not to much in it. I played in 51 minutes all the game and have unlocked all weapons. \n\nPro\n+ Grafik is ok (on some levels even great :)\n+ Weapons are implemented in a good way (laser for aim)\n+ Makes fun for some rounds\n+ A good game for the 50% off sale\n\nContra\n- Not much content at the moment\n- More balance needed. The turret kills everything till level 3, with the mini-spider bot you can go till level 4 or 5 without shooting any bullet. \n- You can't deactivate the turret or the spider bot. That makes each map borring till level 7\n\n\nExample\n- I played the map space till level 5 to receive the spider\n- then map sky till the machine-gun and then till the turret\n- back to map space till level 10 ->upgrade for the spider\n->now with this combo, nothing can stop you :(",
